@host = http://localhost:5044

### List
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "MOU-001", "name": "Mouse", "unitPrice": 25.50, "reorderLevel": 10 }

### Duplicate SKU, should give 409
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "MOU-001", "name": "Mouse again", "unitPrice": 25.50, "reorderLevel": 10 }

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "MOU-001", "name": "Wireless Mouse", "unitPrice": 29.90, "reorderLevel": 10, "isActive": true }